DTEND:2026-02-25T02:00:00+00:00
SUMMARY:Free Food/Stuff @ Paint Your Pet - RSVP FULL, WAITLIST ONLY
DESCRIPTION:<p>Paint a custom paint-by-number of your favorite furry friend! No pet, no problem! Redbirds without pets may participate and paint Pawfficer Korg or Reggie!</p>
<p>Limited spots available. Participants MUST RSVP to this event AND submit a photo by February 6 to participate. Once you have RSVP'd, you will receive an email with a link to submit your photo. Both must be complete by February 6.&nbsp;</p>
<p>This event is hosted by Event Management, Dining, and Hospitality and Redbird Well.&nbsp;</p>
<p><em>If you need accommodation to fully participate in this program/event, please contact Event Management, Dining, and Hospitality at 309-438-8351 or EMDH@IllinoisState.edu. Please allow sufficient time to arrange the accommodation.</em></p>
LOCATION:Brown Ballroom, Bone Student Center
END:VEVENT
